msgctxt "284"
msgid "Just a minute, son. You're not heading to West Park, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't have time to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Really? You don't look busy. Looked to me like you were just strolling "
"around..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Anyway, sorry to bother you. I'm sure you got somewhere to be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Still, it's a shame that we've come to a point in our modern society where "
"people can't even bother to give each other the time of day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Oh, don't mind me... Just talkin' to myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "I was planning to. Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Well, I wouldn't say that... But hardly anyone ever goes there since the "
"Majima Family swooped in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"I see... I thought all of the homeless people who lived here were kicked "
"out. What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"I guess I just couldn't say goodbye. Been here too long... Even the "
"homeless can get attached to their surroundings, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Actually, I know just about everything there is to know about this park. Go "
"ahead, ask me a question! Try and stump me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Hm? Well, I don't really have any questions..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Oh, I find that hard to believe. C'mon, I'll bet you got loads of 'em. If "
"you don't ask me now, you'll regret it! We'll start simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Take this place's name for example. I bet you don't know why it's called "
"West Park even though it's on the northeast side of Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "The origin of the park's name...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Sure, I know that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Is that so...? Sounds kinda fishy to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Actually, why do they call it \"West Park?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Well... Why do you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Because it's on the west side of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"I just told you it's on the northeast side of town.\r\n"
"Are you even listening?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Actually, it turns out it was a mistake made by city hall!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"Apparently, the head of town planning at city hall was kinda sloppy and "
"messed up the name on the map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "The park was open almost four years before anybody noticed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"I guess people figured there must've been a good reason to name the park "
"like that, so they never questioned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "I can see how that would happen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"It wasn't until they received an inquiry from someone who visited the park "
"that the mistake was brought to light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"I suppose they could've changed it to East Park, but it's not like it had "
"another West Park to compete with, so they just decided to leave it as is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "That's quite a story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Granted, most of us just call the place \"Purgatory\" now, so I guess it "
"doesn't really matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Guess not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Because a man named West built it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Hahaha! That's a good one, but nope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Actually, it turns out it was a mistake made by city hall!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"Apparently, the head of town planning at city hall was kinda sloppy and "
"messed up the name on the map."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "The park was open almost four years before anybody noticed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"I guess people figured there must've been a good reason to name the park "
"like that, so they never questioned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "I can see how that would happen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"It wasn't until they received an inquiry from someone who visited the park "
"that the mistake was brought to light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"I suppose they could've changed it to East Park, but it's not like it had "
"another West Park to compete with, so they just decided to leave it as is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "That's quite a story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"Granted, most of us just call the place \"Purgatory\" now, so I guess it "
"doesn't really matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Guess not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "By the way... I believe the man who built it was named Hirayama-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Was it just a mistake?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Precisely! I suppose it's not the most interesting answer, but yeah, it was "
"just a mistake from someone at city hall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Happens, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Now then, do you know why they call this place \"Purgatory\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Everybody knows that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"Really...? Rats, I thought I was the only one. I'll have to think of some "
"better questions..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "By all means, tell me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"Traditionally speaking, Purgatory is a place between this world and the "
"next where the dead are purified before they're sent off to heaven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "In other words, people thought there was another world beyond this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid ""
"Hmm... So this side of the door is the land of the living, and the other "
"side is the land of the dead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid ""
"In a way. You see, compared to the outside world, this park was just a "
"little bit closer to heaven. At least... that's how it was for us homeless "
"people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"We didn't have to worry about cops harassing us or some punk kids trying to "
"beat us up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "The streets of Kamurocho were like hell compared to Purgatory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "That explains a lot... I guess one man's hell is another man's heaven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"There used to be a secret network of rooms beneath Purgatory where the "
"wealthy could drink and gamble all they wanted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"But now that it's deserted, the place has a lot more in common with hell "
"than it does heaven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "What's it like now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid ""
"That's one question I can't answer. If you're lookin' to find out, you'll "
"have to go inside and see for yourself. You'll wanna be real careful, "
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "By the way, have you ever heard of a man they call \"The Florist of Sai\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "Yeah. I know him pretty well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
"He's a legendary informant who ran his whole operation out of Purgatory. "
"Got his name 'cause he'd deliver info to his clients in a bouquet of "
"flowers..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "I wonder what he's up to now...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid ""
"(The Florist moved his base of operations to Millennium Tower during the "
"incident with the Jingweon Mafia then went back to Purgatory...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid ""
"(Not sure where he is now, though. I guess I should've asked Date-san about "
"it...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "That's all I have to say. Sorry to bother you, son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Ignore Him"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "Hear Him Out"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "Sure, I know that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "Actually, why do they call it \"West Park?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Because it's on the west side of town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "Because a man named West built it."
msgstr ""

